.Dd October 26, 2026
.Dt PRINTF-MODIFIERS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm printf-modifiers
.Nd printf formatting fields are not command flags
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Bl -tag -width field
.It Cm #
Use an alternate format.
.It Cm -
Left-adjust the output field.
.It Cm +
Always put a sign before a number.
.It Cm 0
Pad the field with zeroes.
.El
